{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19904","headline":"乙酉岁舍弟扶侍归兴义庄居後独止舍待替人 · 孟郊","name":"乙酉岁舍弟扶侍归兴义庄居後独止舍待替人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁言旧居止，主人忽成客。\n僮仆强与言，相惧终脉脉。\n出亦何所求，入亦何所索。\n饮食迷精麤，衣裳失宽窄。\n回风卷闲簟，新月生空壁。\n士有百役身，官无一姓宅。\n丈夫耻自餙，衰须从飒白。\n兰交早已谢，榆景徒相迫。\n惟予心中镜，不语光历历。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}